{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "6a19b4ff-c475-84e6-8ada-46fd490bb8d5",
  "created_at": "2026-01-09T13:26:40-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Sofia Costa",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:24:29-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:24:32-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hello. My name is Sofia Costa. I am calling about flooding at 248 Marsh Street, in The Point. Water is coming from the storm today."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:24:42-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, Ms. Costa. Where is the water, exactly? In the street, or on your property?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:24:49-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Parking lot behind the building. It slopes toward the back door, so all the water goes there. Now the entrance is flooded. Water is at the door."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:25:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So the lot drains toward the back entrance and it's pooling there. Is any of it getting inside?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:25:08-05:00",
      "duration": 23,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not inside yet. Only at the step. But I am worried also about the street. It is close to the water, and there are children walking and people with dogs. They go near the edge to look at the waves. I just came back from driving lesson with my son, he is learning to drive, and we saw people very close."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:25:31-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that's a real concern in this weather. Is the water in the street deep, or is it mostly the lot?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:25:40-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mostly the lot, and some on the street by the corner. Not so deep, maybe over the curb in places."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:25:48-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I'm putting this in as a flooding report for 248 Marsh Street, with the back lot draining to the rear door. Crews are stretched thin across the city today, so it'll go in the queue with the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Can someone call me back when it is done? I want to know that it is finished."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:11-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. What's the best number for you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:15-05:00",
      "duration": 1,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:16-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-five-four. Right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:18-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:20-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Great. We'll call that number once the work is finished. In the meantime, keep clear of the back door if the water rises, and stay off the flooded part of the street."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, I will. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-09T13:26:36-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome, Ms. Costa. Stay safe out there."
    }
  ],
